{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The Story of a Girl Who Wants to Get Home Soon, and Her Long Path Home.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;The Path Home&quot; is a mysterious\u00a0puzzle game with a 2D pixel-art style, where you gradually transform a mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can use panels to &quot;<strong>flip</strong>&quot; between black and white.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/4a002cfef52c39ad1e3ff782f02c2f82.poster.avif?t=1768568983\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/4a002cfef52c39ad1e3ff782f02c2f82.webm?t=1768568983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/4a002cfef52c39ad1e3ff782f02c2f82.mp4?t=1768568983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The girl is focused on going home, so she\u2019s always looking for the &quot;<strong>shortest route to the goal</strong>.&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s up to you to reshape the puzzle world and guide her to the goal.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if there are <strong>fake goals</strong>, she might get fooled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Block the fake paths or steer her away from them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/0dff6e140a99222674cf89cf07498219.poster.avif?t=1768568983\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/0dff6e140a99222674cf89cf07498219.webm?t=1768568983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/0dff6e140a99222674cf89cf07498219.mp4?t=1768568983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>crow</strong> is your friend.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Lead the girl on a detour to help her reunite with the crow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/7d430b1e61caa67c14611c16dc317c2f.poster.avif?t=1768568983\" width=1170 height=654 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/7d430b1e61caa67c14611c16dc317c2f.webm?t=1768568983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3409620/extras/7d430b1e61caa67c14611c16dc317c2f.mp4?t=1768568983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guide the girl with your &quot;flips&quot; and help her return to her true home.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"#1 Fuuka School Gate \u2013 Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3409620/a93bdfb0e66a8350dc731b714dcd7fbc2fc322a9.jpg"},{"name":"Stage 1-1 Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3409620/b5b0915b76fa3236dc1bbda1895009c160d57db4.jpg"},{"name":"#2 Mayoi-ga \u2013 Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3409620/b60919a4a03b85443c211427525b771127a13f28.jpg"},{"name":"#3 Mahoroba Theme Park \u2013 Cleared","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3409620/c46e3b655f7f4375748de99dac55b7fedb99f076.j